    "html_content": "<h2 style='color: #E67E22; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;'>🎉 Welcome to FruityNest News!</h2><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>We're excited to launch our news system! Here you'll find updates about FruityNest, tutorials, tips, and much more.</p><h3 style='color: #E67E22; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;'>📢 What's New</h3><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>This is our first official news post. We've been working hard to bring you the best FL Studio plugin management experience.</p><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>Some highlights:</p><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 15px;'>• Cloud sync for your projects</p><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 15px;'>• Preset management</p><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 15px;'>• Plugin organization</p><p style='color: #B8A082; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>• And much more!</p><h3 style='color: #E67E22; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;'>🎬 Tutorial Video</h3><div style='background: #252E33; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; margin: 15px 0;'><p style='color: #808080; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;'>🎬 FL Studio Tutorial - Getting Started</p><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pDIsEZsalAo'><img src='https://img.youtube.com/vi/pDIsEZsalAo/mqdefault.jpg' style='width: 100%; max-width: 320px; border-radius: 4px;'></a><p style='color: #808080; font-size: 10px; margin-top: 5px;'>Click to watch on YouTube</p></div><h3 style='color: #E67E22; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;'>🎵 Featured Track</h3><div style='background: #252E33; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; margin: 15px 0;'><p style='color: #808080; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;'>🎵 Demo Track</p><a href='https://soundcloud.com/fl-studio-official' style='color: #E67E22; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px;'>▶️ Listen on SoundCloud</a></div><hr style='border: none; border-top: 1px solid #3a3a3a; margin: 20px 0;'><p style='color: #808080; font-size: 11px; text-align: center;'>Stay tuned for more updates! 🍊</p>"
